{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UFOntastic</strong> is an adventure game based on exploration, where the main mechanic is to absorb objects from the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use your flying saucer to abduct objects, characters, or enemies, and then use them to overcome the various dungeons. Try to collect valuable objects so that the protagonist, Jano, can sell them and pay off his outstanding debt. But be careful not to attract too much attention during your adventure, as some characters may attack you or even call the police to arrest you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, it features a local multiplayer mode to compete against a friend in various mini-games!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912600?t=1758670740","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912600?t=1758670740","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912600/8b8f9b2cfc56eacbf370edf7eab3465a8f174e9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758670740","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912600/8b8f9b2cfc56eacbf370edf7eab3465a8f174e9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758670740","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UFOntastic</strong> is an adventure game based on exploration, where the main mechanic is to absorb objects from the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use your flying saucer to abduct objects, characters, or enemies, and th